{"height": 8, "weight": 215, "base_experience": 175, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 2}], "genus": "Wrestling Pokémon", "capture_rate": 100, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["flying", "humanshape"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ルチャブル"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Luchabull"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "루차불"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "摔角鷹人"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Brutalibré"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Resladero"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Hawlucha"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Hawlucha"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ルチャブル"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "摔角鹰人"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Hawlucha"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama."}, {"versions": ["y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It overwhelms opponents with quick moves, but sometimes it showboats for too long when it’s using a special move and gets itself into a pinch."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "In combat, Hawlucha leaps nimbly about, taking advantage of its opponents’ blind spots. It’s also skilled at using superb submission holds."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ix/scarlet-violet/701.png", "shiny": null}}, "gener